description:
Design a 32-bit wide byte-reverser circuit that reorganizes the order of the input bytes. The module takes a 32-bit input and outputs the bytes in reverse order: the first byte of the output comes from the last byte of the input and so on. The design uses intermediate registers to achieve this functionality through a three-stage pipeline, ensuring that the input bytes are processed and rearranged efficiently.
module top_module(
    input [31:0] in,
    output [31:0] out
);

